; creatures.xon -- the delve set: what lives in the drowned mine.
;
; Beyond the classic traits: (pack LO HI) puts that many down together;
; ranged lets fly (ranged LO HI) along a line, said as (shot "what");
; summon calls a (summon "name") to its side while you are in view.

